{"productId": "aaa160c6-b166-41f1-affd-325c6dd3698e", "modelName": "Citori CX Micro", "modelDescription": "The Citori features an extreme level of craftsmanship that leads to the dependable function, impeccable looks, championship performance and respect. Its convenient barrel selector allows the shooter to choose which barrel fires on the first pull of the single trigger, and the second pull fires the remaining barrel. The automatic ejectors eject fired shells when the breech is opened and elevate unfired shells for easy removal. The Citori utilizes a transverse-mounted, full-width tapered locking bolt. The tapered locking bolt engages a full-width tapered recess in the rear barrel lugs. The hinge pin extends from one side of the receiver to the other for maximum strength. It also features chrome-plated chambers that resist the toll thousands of shells can take on lesser quality guns. The CX Micro model features adj LOP, blued receiver, Invector-Plus Midas chokes, back-bore technology, and a Triple Trigger system.\n\n", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "7bea943d-f550-4f14-8575-042a0474fc8c", "description": "Browning, Citori CX Micro, Over Under, 12 Gauge, 30\" Barrel, 3\" Chamber, Polished Blued, Right Hand, Gloss Black Walnut, Fixed Adjustable LOP Stock, 2 Rounds", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/3bd09154-62ac-439e-abd9-1a0a2934c36d", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/4971294e-259e-45f7-ac70-16edcf0eabda", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/c237cf4c-e3e4-4bf9-bafb-92cdf3166200"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "018179326", "upc": "023614737575", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "41814500-2324-4f06-ad03-694ec22f5207", "attributeName": "Stock Type", "attributeValueId": "ca49392c-705c-45ef-ab2a-3f9af2da59a3", "valueName": "Fixed"}, {"attributeNameId": "1754fc70-d7bc-4edb-86df-5d08daa969f8", "attributeName": "Gauge", "att